    "detailed_description": "Embark on an adrenaline-fueled journey with Metal Bunny, a thrilling 2D platformer that merges the raw power of metal music. Take control of our fearless protagonist, the Metal Bunny, as you navigate through a series of electrifying levels filled with challenges and obstacles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843660/extras/4ee094b07c10d15ccd809bfe4f38698d.avif?t=1728763661\" width=616 height=248 /></span><br><br>In Metal Bunny, rhythm is key, where you can jump only into the pulsating beats of metal music. If you get lost in rhythm you will guided by a metronome that keeps you in perfect time. With each leap synchronized to the rhythm, you'll unleash the full potential of Metal Bunny's abilities, propelling yourself through the air with precision and grace.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843660/extras/29c41377f32ce91a265e0273d46deb05.avif?t=1728763661\" width=616 height=248 /></span><br><br>Immerse yourself in the world of Metal Bunny with growl sound effects that perfectly complement the intense metal soundtrack. Feel the roar of the music as you unleash Metal Bunny's power and conquer each level with style.<br><br>Get ready to rock out with Metal Bunny - the ultimate rhythm-based platformer that will test your reflexes, timing, and metal prowess like never before!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It's not just a game, it's a headbanging adventure!</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "Embark on an adrenaline-fueled journey with Metal Bunny, a thrilling 2D platformer that merges the raw power of metal music. Take control of our fearless protagonist, the Metal Bunny, as you navigate through a series of electrifying levels filled with challenges and obstacles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843660/extras/4ee094b07c10d15ccd809bfe4f38698d.avif?t=1728763661\" width=616 height=248 /></span><br><br>In Metal Bunny, rhythm is key, where you can jump only into the pulsating beats of metal music. If you get lost in rhythm you will guided by a metronome that keeps you in perfect time. With each leap synchronized to the rhythm, you'll unleash the full potential of Metal Bunny's abilities, propelling yourself through the air with precision and grace.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843660/extras/29c41377f32ce91a265e0273d46deb05.avif?t=1728763661\" width=616 height=248 /></span><br><br>Immerse yourself in the world of Metal Bunny with growl sound effects that perfectly complement the intense metal soundtrack. Feel the roar of the music as you unleash Metal Bunny's power and conquer each level with style.<br><br>Get ready to rock out with Metal Bunny - the ultimate rhythm-based platformer that will test your reflexes, timing, and metal prowess like never before!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It's not just a game, it's a headbanging adventure!</h2>",
    "short_description": "Feel the thunderous beats in your bones and let the electrifying guitar riffs guide your way. It's not just a game, it's a headbanging adventure!",
